{{2023 UCI Road World Championships}}

The '''[[UCI Road World Championships&nbsp;– Men's time trial|Men's time trial]]''' of the [[2023 UCI Road World Championships]] was a cycling event that took place on 11 August 2023 in [[Stirling]], [[Scotland]]. It was the 30th edition of the championship, for which [[Tobias Foss]] of [[Norway]] was the defending champion, having won in [[2022 UCI Road World Championships&nbsp;– Men's time trial|2022]].

